# Native and stale generated outputs must never be committed going forward.
# Already-tracked build/dist files stay tracked until an explicit untracking
# decision; these rules only keep new/stale artifacts (e.g. dist/build copies
# of the native ABI, temp cache writes, pack tarballs) untracked.
